# Benefits Section: Immersion Neumorphism Redesign

We will update the [Benefits.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Benefits.tsx) component to create an "immersion" effect where the cards appear to be carved into the screen background.

## Proposed Changes

### [Benefits Component]
#### [MODIFY] [Benefits.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Benefits.tsx)
-   Change the default shadow of the cards from outward to **inset** (inmersión).
-   Remove any card-level movement on hover (no translate-y).
-   Implement a subtle micro-animation for the icon on hover (slight movement).
-   Keep the icon container with a distinct neumorphic style to maintain depth.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure no UI breakages.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of the "inset" look for the cards.
- Verify that hovering on the card animates the icon correctly without moving the card.
